ion of a set $T$ is a collection of non-empty subsets of $T$ where every element of $T$ is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nOf the given collections, only $\\{\\{0,10\\},\\{2,4,6,8\\}\\}$ is a partition.\n\nThe rest of the collections are not partitions:\n\n- $\\{∅,\\{0,2,4,6,8\\},\\{10\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the subset $∅$ is empty.\n\n- $\\{\\{0,2,4,6,8,10,12\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the element $12$ does not appear in $T.$\n\n- $\\{\\{0,10\\},\\{2\\},\\{4,8\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the element $6\\in T$ does not appear in any subset.\n\n- $\\{\\{0,10\\},\\{2,4,6,8,10\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the element $10$ appears in two subsets." 13194139535332 17592186045417 true] [17592186417775 1074 "A partition of a set $T$ is a collection of non-empty subsets of $T$ where every element of $T$ is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nOf the given collections, only ${{0,10},{2,4,6,8}}$ is a partition.\n\nThe rest of the collections are not partitions:\n\n- ${∅,{0,2,4,6,8},{10}}$ is not a partition because the subset $∅$ is empty.\n\n- ${{0,2,4,6,8,10,12}}$ is not a partition because the element $12$ does not appear in $T.$\n\n- ${{0,10},{2},{4,8}}$ is not a partition because the element $6\\in T$ does not appear in any subset.\n\n- ${{0,10},{2,4,6,8,10}}$ is not a partition because the element $10$ appears in two subsets." 13194139535332 17592186045417 false] [17592186417776 1071 "If $B=\\{-2,-1,0,1,2\\}$, which collection of subsets of $B$ is a partition of $B?$" 13194139535332 17592186045417 true] [17592186417776 1071 "If $B={-2,-1,0,1,2}$, which collection of subsets of $B$ is a partition of $B?$" 13194139535332 17592186045417 false] [17592186417776 1074 "A partition of a set $B$ is a collection of non-empty subsets of $B$ where every element of $B$ is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nOf the given collections, only $\\{\\{-2,0\\},\\{-1,1\\},\\{2\\}\\}$ is a partition.\n\nThe rest of the collections are not partitions:\n\